G26: compile the port-owned streaming download store. PNG and JPEG are
decoded by upstream's handlers with fx-24's DCT-scaled JPEG and fx-24b's
sampled PNG decoding under the image ledger; G26's own full-size PNG/JPEG
handler (port/raster_content.c) registered after them and replaced both, so
any photograph above one megapixel was refused by the bitmap admission and
not shown. It is no longer compiled or registered.

--- a/netsurf/frontends/framebuffer/Makefile
+++ b/netsurf/frontends/framebuffer/Makefile
@@ -182,1 +182,2 @@
+S_FRONTEND += ciuki/download_store.c
 S_FRONTEND += ciuki/net.c ciuki/http.c ciuki/tls.c ciuki/dns.c
